a than to show that a legible, few-thousand-line assistant is enough to open apps, type into them, run searches, coordinate concurrent actions, recover from single-step failures, and be driven entirely from a phone in another room -- without the LLM ever touching the keyboard.ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;EvW-eP1cWqVWY3sj1sgY_Mlxy0t1yYR-cyvZTOC3BlYƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxfAnovaX: A Local, Multi-Agent Voice Assistant with LLM Planning, Typed Executors, and Adaptive Recoveryƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;eF3qpBJPXMGgLlKLhuVo6uPCiVaTrMMYJ7n8yRwyczEƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkoSyndicationItemƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;qc4GTCvmDMrE2dC0tP3bCWDesH40_JSL0cbhBbcmtBUƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.15367ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;f99nIX-6OWFJcKotZq66kKGDPi0TecZ_fuDIx-1o5iEƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx`anovax-a-local-multi-agent-voice-assistant-with-llm-planning-typed-executors-and-adaptive-recoveƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;fB-_Cu7fvjobfBgBLnFYNQICp6-iE8d7hIm1iCoGiScƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkwSyndicationSourceBundleƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;u9gLYoL2lrSodIBHU56twr0HX5AGa3l1Zspb7w4sFJUƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkjtechnologyƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;4ggfsa4Xi_U8DPVSKjLgGm1rND_nh346i7N1qroNdTQƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;OEAzZ__x-CfKRnQbwvCEh_Vian0j8KjdgJ-bokmm268ƒdpai